=== D: vacuity of v1 Definition 4.11 (unlinked pairs) ===
Fix any s in Ctrl(rho). A diagonal baseline may append battery-burning
cycles (unitary on W+B that dumps battery free energy into the bath is a
battery-assisted thermal operation acting trivially on S, so it preserves
Delta[rho] maintenance). Its asymptotic power P(s_diag) can be made any
P0 > 0, hence inf over unlinked pairs of [P(s) - P(s_diag)] = -infinity.
Consequently v1's Pextra = -inf and v1 Theorem 4.12 cannot hold as stated.
